{
    "title": "MSNBC: Watch Live & Analysis",
    "description": "MSNBC app brings you the latest breaking news and in-depth analysis of daily news headlines. Watch MSNBC live, listen to live audio 24/7 or catch up on full episodes of your favorite MSNBC shows. Understand today\u2019s news with insightful commentary and informed perspectives from award-winning journalists and trusted experts. Keep up with the latest news in politics and government \u2013 including the 2024 presidential election \u2013 as well as topics spanning pop culture, current events and the trends that shape our world.\r\n\r\nStream the latest TV shows from MSNBC including:\r\nThe Rachel Maddow Show\r\nMorning Joe\r\nInside with Jen Psaki\r\nDeadline: White House with Nicolle Wallace\r\nAll In with Chris Hayes\r\nThe Beat with Ari Melber\r\nThe Reidout with Joy Reid\r\nThe Last Word with Lawrence O\u2019Donnell\r\nThe 11th Hour with Stephanie Ruhle\r\nWay Too Early with Jonathan Lemire\r\nAlex Wagner Tonight\r\n\r\nMSNBC app features:\r\nWatch MSNBC live and stream MSNBC shows on demand when signed in with your TV provider\r\nRead top perspectives and analysis from MSNBC experts and columnists\r\nView breaking news headlines and daily news stories at a glance from your home screen\r\nListen to live streaming audio including the MSNBC live broadcast, NBC News NOW, CNBC and more on-the-go\r\nWatch top moments and video clips from MSNBC shows\r\n\r\nAdditional Information\r\nPlease note that use of the MSNBC app is limited to the United States and its territories\r\nVideo is accessible via 3G, 4G, LTE and Wi-Fi networks \u2013 data charges may apply\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy?brandA=MSNBC&intake=MSNBC\r\nYour Privacy Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo?brandA=MSNBC&intake=MSNBC\r\nCA Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act?intake=MSNBC\r\n\r\nThis app features Nielsen proprietary measurement software which will allow you to contribute to market research, like Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings.\r\nTo learn more about our digital measurement products and your choices in regard to them, please visit http://www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information.",
    "descriptionHTML": "MSNBC app brings you the latest breaking news and in-depth analysis of daily news headlines. Watch MSNBC live, listen to live audio 24/7 or catch up on full episodes of your favorite MSNBC shows. Understand today\u2019s news with insightful commentary and informed perspectives from award-winning journalists and trusted experts. Keep up with the latest news in politics and government \u2013 including the 2024 presidential election \u2013 as well as topics spanning pop culture, current events and the trends that shape our world.<br><br>Stream the latest TV shows from MSNBC including:<br>The Rachel Maddow Show<br>Morning Joe<br>Inside with Jen Psaki<br>Deadline: White House with Nicolle Wallace<br>All In with Chris Hayes<br>The Beat with Ari Melber<br>The Reidout with Joy Reid<br>The Last Word with Lawrence O\u2019Donnell<br>The 11th Hour with Stephanie Ruhle<br>Way Too Early with Jonathan Lemire<br>Alex Wagner Tonight<br><br>MSNBC app features:<br>Watch MSNBC live and stream MSNBC shows on demand when signed in with your TV provider<br>Read top perspectives and analysis from MSNBC experts and columnists<br>View breaking news headlines and daily news stories at a glance from your home screen<br>Listen to live streaming audio including the MSNBC live broadcast, NBC News NOW, CNBC and more on-the-go<br>Watch top moments and video clips from MSNBC shows<br><br>Additional Information<br>Please note that use of the MSNBC app is limited to the United States and its territories<br>Video is accessible via 3G, 4G, LTE and Wi-Fi networks \u2013 data charges may apply<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy?brandA=MSNBC&amp;intake=MSNBC<br>Your Privacy Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo?brandA=MSNBC&amp;intake=MSNBC<br>CA Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act?intake=MSNBC<br><br>This app features Nielsen proprietary measurement software which will allow you to contribute to marke